Second slashem ascension, and second in a row, too.  If I don't count 
the two characters lost by crashing games that means 2 ascensions in 14 
games.

This was Brenda, my valkyrie no. 8; the one for whom Boudewijn had 
called on bets how she would die, and for whom Irina Rempt suggested 
jokingly that she would die from a collapsing drawbridge, just as my 
preceding valkyrie had.  Essentially, this was a game with no *major* 
mistakes (comparing to my ascended monk Luther who had committed three 
major blunders).

Since I did not get much feedback on my last three ascension posts (one 
person each time answered to two of them and nobody to the remaining 
one), I will not write a long ascension story (no good ratio of effort 
to results :-) ).  I'll just paste my logfile, from which you can gather 
the story yourself.  After that, I'll paste part of the game messages on 
ascension.


